- Migrate build toolchain to Conan 2 and venvpp2
- Point scripts submodule to TeiaCare/venvpp2
- Bump Windows MSVC profile to compiler.version=194
### Fixed
- MSVC C4458 variable shadowing in histogram and summary tests
- Remove empty `requires` to fix `conan create` in Conan 2
